<title>POLAND: BOC to invest $50 mln in Poland.</title>
<headline>BOC to invest $50 mln in Poland.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial gas group BOC Plc will sign a contract on Friday worth $50 million with a Polish nitrogen firm on building a modern factory to produce technical gases, Rzeczpospolita daily said, quoting no sources.</p>
<p>The paper on Thursday said that under the deal BOC would build the factory in two years time and the Polish company, Zaklady Azotowe Kedzierzyn, would buy gases from the factory during the next 15 years.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
